{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1251,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6036e77bbfb0d6f39e85336d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不敢一个人走夜路的话我可以陪你\r\n一起回去喔。看到我这身打扮，\r\n反倒是妖魔鬼怪要怕我啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "578111d742a66fa5c66a5ace3130f160b1417cd7e9637f355adeeec9e9f06432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db967b8e987487ea91e1aed1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看我以白色春雷之姿，为新生们\r\n示范跑步的基础吧！让她们见识\r\n背负各种意念的跑姿长什么样子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7445abd197b579c02d3d7bed6ea67570804f0601cfd95c2293ace9cbcf5f024b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82ee086ab2c464d32120f2db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件和服裤的侧边有个大开口，\r\n刚穿上时总觉得不太自在……\r\n但天气热时还满凉爽的嘛～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a692b54edc7a70ea21cd95f9350ccc21e61c148dfa2e38a04ac931abb114c670",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d0d402a6bd5f9c1d4a4c044",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在可是打雷的季节，有没有\r\n什么供品啊～？像我老家的章鱼\r\n正好是产季，吃起来超有嚼劲说～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4d4ebfd77fa14782fcc1bc64d7ff1191ca61c98518f1be9ffd0b2d53c22334b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:697e537c2ccd8009386ee421",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天的时候神明也只要窝在神社里\r\n暖暖地度过就好了说。\r\n毕竟天气冷实在太难熬了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e13ecbbe677bca19b9041740e5fc42bf7efa84c9d793026daaaafb54f3e31693",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ee32df853fd0c8eb61c1128",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcf91bfe47382364e66302db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:337327de93933a8b5572eea6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "溪流的口袋到底是怎么回事……？\r\n为什么总是有拿不完的糖果！？\r\n越来越觉得可怕了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95b069ad4c4850b0919b057e39fc72c34480f7bafb5effc337ccb5fdd310fe61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1e59ab1cc569d6759b61f92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟装傻的人比起来吐槽的人\r\n实在严重不足……话说回来，\r\n大家的装傻也太有特色了吧……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1877908bd8a4832d58c6a36f92de1008a86beb754f4ba354c354601c73d84ada",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba85f7a127d0a34a287d2468",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "城市好厉害啊。问她知道什么\r\n好服饰店吗？她就会推荐\r\n便宜又有品味的店家。真是可靠啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1b1e4d034edeb369ecea2400245e62d072d04e5855cc2da9651de3bbbf32ec0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19bad5e194fa93accb1a8f7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "青竹和进王在做什么……！？\r\n虽然很想问，\r\n但又不想知道……！！唔啊啊～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d91ec4b80f836e89af31de6bcdd453d7e247c9c9e6e5dcf740f4a81246bbd25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:234410bf3f4d0b78baac93b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍真是不错啊。\r\n总是会有人在，让人很踏实。\r\n感觉就像我老家一样～",
      "source_fingerprint": "192791c1b6d41c95b82db7c0b8b407f6608207f2cb426d3cc181fef4f8a78c7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e55f0732cf86373a3df3ee42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样，穿上这套服装后，\r\n看起来有模有样了吧！只要穿成\r\n这样──呃，这个人是谁啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ddd330df5ff3d8e65e62ba6af001688f1e9438939e9f2978be029197695aacf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a26276d70557b91882478476",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服啊，材质应该相当不错吧。\r\n话虽如此，我穿起来还是有点\r\n坐立难安……",
      "source_fingerprint": "081636301b84369b519e71cbcbff4e98ebbdd4ec28b1ec11a0307ea599c0ad5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72418ebde3a41cb0ed34756f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是「白色闪电」！！哎呀～\r\n彷佛能看到爸爸开心的神情喔。\r\n我会好好努力，不辜负他的期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "154888e272fa492b31b9747fb09ff99839cb877fdd9f8024f0a3311b6c803fa0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c19bdcb734e5b5fe73491cab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很帅气吧？看起来很快吧！？\r\n放心吧，我会让大家知道，\r\n我的速度真的很快！",
      "source_fingerprint": "665eff2060d7d8085dbc9df36d526aaf0a9e7c2c8ba1a28e2e438a1c739c31d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea35dee7ae563bc9afc5040b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还想说一大早就听到不对劲的声响，\r\n原来是天狼星在健身房乱踢乱闹……\r\n她到底是想要踢什么！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a606f5bfa2f30227c80d74e2c90894e80e26383bbeb943f753360ef99fc920a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:918d9b6143d4e3d6f2691187",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一讲到假日的中午，就会想到\r\n那个节目喔。在难波的著名剧场\r\n进行的──那个节目！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02eb6cb44006e670877047e98e288f4f4be10b166cfb3f6142f4c8360221d658",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48d4baef2f5e237b98ca724a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打个电话回家好了。\r\n爸爸妈妈动不动就逞强……\r\n真的是没办法抛下他们不管。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b41179b1f68d4fa341f28471c6e4ad6326e77451b120483e27afc62118312399",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78a5b92510318bc669895ca1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这边的樱饼，\r\n饼皮的部分好～～～薄喔。\r\n这样能吃饱吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "03040176b58d46b05bef1ef34a82759acc53047e04368366e20d1e8b739dbeb6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e79da2e0cc96f5d983946aaa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想喝冰凉的糖水了。\r\n虽然刚开始觉得味道很怪，\r\n但渐渐就喝上瘾了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de60ef1e3595e0a9875bafe3d9d2bd36dd34c0a0a404a6d89293be70bd00d02b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5418eb28da61f9c77ae4f0f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "热的乌龙面很好吃，\r\n但乌龙冷面也很好吃耶……\r\n在这种时节，真让人犹豫……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd719fc5d9497c4a0a6c2d4b366987c0c949dd797a9d7251ab6b802bbaa09eb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dcbca7491d4f5fcb10f8e80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我告诉你撑过寒冬的小知识吧。\r\n……只要一直到处跑就不会冷咯。\r\n哇～哈哈哈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15dc789bafe1a2edb93378812570c9573938ade51ead1c186a6859352c2542de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37fd6ee363f896e6aa784c38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小不点们常常画我喔，\r\n嘿嘿，下次叫他们画画看\r\n我这身打扮吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebbe88fbe42738a7bf8510bcc917ab05e9344d578d925c879757a129be7262fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d9ba2a014498e65b464e897",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小溪那家伙一脸开心地想把这块布\r\n挂在我脖子上……这怎么看\r\n都不是围兜而是腰布吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3f3f09909047ced1e1d15351aee406613643a5d1c8d3abf085d655aa1467804",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b09b0ebbcb91d783cadc696",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我只是在想不知道「神马」有什么\r\n神秘的传说，为什么鲁道夫会突然\r\n笑出来……啊……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f79bac50d4a70c9fdbc92c6a842861851e7958a45e840951304eacc5673a35d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe138c8dbc46310e7fbca945",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这发型是小栗帮我绑的。\r\n因为靠自己绑这么高很麻烦，\r\n而且她好像很擅长绑头发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1df78b43864aeface29b61c234840dd557dcd1aedbc8ccb74b0d7ba744401523",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f561021cd8da805c9d51b2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我穿成这样跟稻荷吵架，\r\n结果突然就打雷起风了……\r\n真是逃不过神明的眼睛啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d52cf77cd166185fbae2b3e14645f88895743c073269980ad48a2b5840fc206",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7570038ab0af03684c3073ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸，新的一天开始啰。\r\n还不打起精神？\r\n不然我来电你一下让你清醒好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f49c8b1bc239394c2d30110d69bc80772913099dcd28a54dcced08c6179df4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2537e9ba618584a285ea22e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午休时间老是有一群人到我面前\r\n排队，说想商量烦恼、许愿……\r\n我可没办法保佑愿望实现啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4952cca4caacfeb18318995f0f77350c43f3733acbe2d2dbe62a1a78af1af5a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13d849bc385e08f74e0dc05a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听着远方雷声有助于集中精神喔。\r\n我也常常边听边念书。\r\n有兴趣的话下次借你CD吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0fa331d7600bb73adbe064d2bb7aaccc47b4e81ff0b3b819cfd62631246b60d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea90e786f1d06497d971eca0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道现在这季节很舒适，\r\n但可不能松懈喔。\r\n神明随时看在眼里啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "908a7c137d7416caf363cc457e8abd8140a2a821a8a49159ef482465683e992b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f38335b2412be77f9fd18e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阳光太强时得躲到阴影处才行……\r\n穿着黑衣可是会越来越热，\r\n最后被煎成小玉烧的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc2660d8d4ae1ba8094954c41135d134691ed4927c4956590fe292b4230250ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40aa43fec5fa9b712b5dd876",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这季节气候很干燥，\r\n记得要多喝水喔！\r\n只要喝水，就能精神百倍！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99e9631b5d56624f652ee61da3a59d54999af0c297a502db3a3d60626994ed86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9461ffd80de4aa1baa7d6c93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天得好好补充精力！\r\n在不勉强的范围内好好吃饱，\r\n一起度过这个冬天吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55795a34b391c5df5010621ba1fefdb16218480373cab06764fdd9795c8b2bd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d210008e3f255c6fdbb200a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都说我这身打扮很神圣耶。\r\n意思是说我是神明对吧？\r\n那……我应该就是吐槽之神啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e65b5091fa743a3b95ac1f3455edc581f6c1a0f7f5d0f130cdf6c233e5921ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bf5ff16ae14ca35333f8984",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这副耳罩虽然会完全包住耳朵，\r\n但还是可以听得很清楚喔。\r\n哦！我听到有人在装傻欠吐槽喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a3651f4d3ba9d4932f3ae05a8b870b64c076f97cea2638207736bbac706bc23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8704da8c2f94e56a64c554a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赶快开始吧！\r\n别浪费时间了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "318221b7fb8f6ddf2bbbfb76121be02b76322fd26cfb3dcdc239264b56eb6d00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0874b9ee00aa80843cd55f14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くでぇ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d054221f2f68cebdeb3e707011c8aa079b51f029722f2b93f7de0c387069b06f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d756ad0f62639b1faef0cfb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉很棒的训练，就麻烦了！\r\n……总之，意思就是\r\n一切交给你了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2806aa2d9a52f16242b639de45c2b9ba6955e0409f14ce0f5c8a1539c377e1d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08159163cc05fb14017c7ced",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园好厉害啊。\r\n设施充实的程度真不是盖的！\r\n这样我也能在巨星之道上勇往直前了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c420cd2817f3ecbe85f3c5ea09288cc2f7e9068652e25cf261e55df50c41c00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b9e0656f316ddb97b291f3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拜托要让我大获全胜喔。\r\n可不能辜负了\r\n小不点他们的期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b842ddc16ba33803a1bd5c10d89ba7feb800ec7125c00e66f2417740b52bc28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84eaecb36b043afd565c7673",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "结束后要去采购啊……\r\n今天那家超市很便宜──\r\n……啊～我在自言自语！",
      "source_fingerprint": "679647d5574dd95438fb04f5aa01d99c9f03a7957f0ad80d4e0db4a05c068edc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5215bf6573bef151d69fa971",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唯独成长空间我敢自称\r\n天下第一啊！\r\n我会不断成长的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddbf16f9ad90c7633160cde027d8e87a0a930522809ebd9af589fbdbb34144cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe54582497ad4ae3218bae4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也想让哪个人看到\r\n你努力的样子吗？如果是的话，\r\n我可以帮你喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d49750c48e4e8405880d54e7d53459f5a02bc1ddcc8fff4f7fb23845950d49b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b5bce6c9f38eed45e91846b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既可以训练又能享受到旅行的感觉，\r\n实在是太一举两得了！\r\n哎呀～夏季集训最棒了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "987bc6d28cd7b7ee13853c2a01fc9456c3e831933cc99f86637a220f9f7adfe0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42724ba842174073c84c8610",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦，走吧！\r\n充电完毕！电力满满！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfff2dbc33c678745192fdd2190345bbb514d07fdc5ea3ac975da6197554cf91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e3d0da906f49c6ac0de68a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "举头三尺有神明！\r\n不可以偷懒啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "248d1c62e5133469d9adbad5aafc1428459b2ef9d6f7fc40e1fb287174433758",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b63499660fdcf5835fb527a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经做好万全准备了！\r\n身心都像注连绳一样\r\n绷得紧紧的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5aaa1149ae91c9f1fd90d30da2128f192898b2a534c21a32b4824296217706e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3c2a08d0936ff1bfa664049",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这身打扮让我心中的热情\r\n蠢蠢欲动，快要无法控制了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44e210f5aebd34822c1786d2b8f89a17f35d2db0ebca6d0f3a89356dc26d999e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2f4cb16a5ce249450eae5c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我背负的东西和别人可不一样。\r\n麻烦安排比平常更辛苦的训练啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c26d77dfbe04949593bb47ab5d209dcb6da2673974c7ece071161ce6a3a02a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42d39e87f3f99099e14a544b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我感到干劲跟实力都不断提升！\r\n好想赶快跑得一鸣惊人\r\n想得不得了啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d4ab40cf19a20ebb396cdb4261a1e2f124b29048ba9123f7849462ec4f9eb87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e718b9ebda1acddfdb396bd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就让你见识见识连神明看了\r\n都会腿软的特大「白色闪电」吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ac587c37d08ff155724790a8e6f5420dbbc5c0efa002b2c35ef6ef218b9d319",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aedfc293dd9eafe33d0a3c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～你还真是可靠的搭档啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1441ada33a7229123a391b853ad7a911737a980f466b1637ad0db48a1624041",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e5d7b5da2868c05404ce259",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「白色闪电」的名号已经威震天下了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0f11d182ecb13993b9862a3d58e2cbd802f6595eab01e8e4f8ab391ab323674",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6437b8eb8d2bd785dc88d3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你跟我一起背负这份意志！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc2082a28ed78bd77baf699acd5a39f054ae73f862620990791331541aa11830",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:337979455320fd3d3710ef67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在历史上留名了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73da38591bbb69de8a1121928e757995f26bfc1f0c6e80225eb62f8baf5e1852",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0fb1f995c899b099c707fc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我感觉到……自己长高了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dd7f10ed8649b1653d6229653637440148bb3e1049e6d75f81ad509683268e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02399e3092639181537ea5f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的实力才不只这样喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8627a2737ec535742dfca2ad9aed43f0cecf0360eedfbe48f62302b61a4808d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf87622e85983becf0e94026",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔，我是玉藻十字！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b54cf7684fd7804a2b62009b879f1634f41ae90109b8eb823816a148e3272dbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15a3d046150093e8613ef92f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风驰电掣的「白色闪电」！\r\n火光四射地参战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c4b1829f1798deb95853b302b8a45e9385e08cd8a4fea03cc65176036965f07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a73b8377cd96b1295afd77f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼，由我来照顾你吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc8414cd865a21ea03753d33ab8384be8b5ccc23ad5961e657327f4d947cea28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26c1c91bf55a7759e13fa437",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "放～心交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "541ab4216c2fe65994369cd4cb469b3a3226ccc2f2a963e3fc85e9afdb00bbcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5494e498186680a10662ad78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我感到令人浑身发麻的强劲力量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be324454c0101dc2825497b39565c04b840c4cd1d3654300ccbf3c1d89c8506e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d4fd5a1ebeff6976b7b2985",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "期待是用来超越的啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26c9845a5bcfe4ead9f29ed8aa99826b8d81fe2181393f7fc6b371e4dcc007a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2442c3b2a6b41f587473312",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要用轰天巨雷，\r\n在历史上留下痕迹！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07f61e3629e1e909441cdd818a0075cb1c3f3c207fb9205cff43f0b17a1b19e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac335d45a61b30fd9332abf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是玉藻十字！好了，走吧──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbac5b1e9bc5cfaaca675c9fc258ca9925218a100532804960d4fdf0b35eaf1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0da1a40e377ac10513273424",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出战吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "45e81659c7d8cb25d832a62bba04333afacea8e9fea56c476c86cbc10fe31713",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf6d0aeae0321561b5f9a873",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能让我自由地奔跑，\n你也需要做好各种各样的觉悟呢…\n不过看起来,已经下定决心了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9811cf103d3a2ea7e8b3c3e16f40cd70fa23e7d1592dff805feb8d0ed7374453",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea39b0ce3e6d6b72aff4bf03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37b0ea50770e74cc57d8f86c94661e324efb2d5121688e3ebb0854357aea8420",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7c744e61492f17838b06740",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdc5376bfb1153fa0e2c9119",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要有你在，\n就有种不管哪里都能去到的感觉呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d1edb1d344710d7381287e72edf78c680ae1ba2dcca0a65a39b57978dcfc696",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07d260fb5a9d6d58fd16c09a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是特别的日子还是平常的日子，\n你都陪在我身边\n所以每一天对我都是重要的回忆哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "09bd2c4555d22e3969e1e1eb53d704d04c8af2cdf94d0826c28438a0cc0b402b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1a6331edff7e404c9773ff7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\n今年也祝愿您万事吉祥……\n什么的～今年也请您多加关照♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd49f2341eb9babca44aa85a5d1e60c2022ffe24fce9cfded016103418ff568f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e61d6623d4e452e29588e9f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年准备了我们主厨做的特别巧克力！\n绝～对很美味，\n一定要尝尝看噢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "959e9d666ecee0920d7ab2b558a829a445fd2cb82af7a76b01b89fb3c0c7db38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f099bda6c7a302704ae2892",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我待会把巧克力和贺卡给你哦。\n不过……上面写的东西，\n就当是我们两个人的秘密吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8071698cf9a64eb9a1627b28ca4d58e78c93adf730e5472cb83a592731329ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5669389979c29f26ca076350",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也用竹子上挂了诗笺哦♪\n在日本学会的折纸，\n真想让城堡里的大家也看看呀～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00a3d45e0da0d2b3f7a2bf01717cc13f9f8f1f4389200d13a597647fe5ca4407",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e1f874589c5e8c0664c27ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "据说万圣节起源于古代凯尔特呢。\n说起来，我家的宝物库里，\n好像也有变装用的衣物哦～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "427f012ac559c4e6756e5683ede219226ec4a398ce1a4869bf0cd44c1ab8ee8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7efae9e751c626ebd609a91a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天宿舍的大家会交换圣诞节礼物呢！\n真有学生的感觉呢♪\n我的礼物会送到谁手上呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "413a34583e7d8972a9bb3927013f989c3b583d4af53d6f2631aefbfb2986227c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:857753aa28105ffa29f9d536",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你今晚有空吗？\n我想去看看街上的灯彩，\n能请您带我一起去吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "291d35af98d439872520b1f44074f9b9a90f31791167929850423c041aaf237c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10009"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
